# Context-pinned Flint variant for OpenCode.
# Build it with:
#   ollama create flint-opencode -f models/Modelfile.flint-opencode
# Verify with:
#   ollama show flint-opencode --parameters
# The setup scripts rewrite this file's FROM line to the tag they
# pulled (MODEL_TAG) before building, so a non-default Flint tag pins
# itself rather than the default build named below.
#
# Why bake this in instead of relying on client settings?
# Ollama's runtime context defaults are much smaller than Flint's 262K
# maximum, and client-side settings do not reliably override them.
# A Modelfile is the one place the value always wins.
#
# 131072 (128K) is the kit default since 2026-11-09: 32K proved
# unusable for real agent work and 128K is the floor. Flint's own ceiling is 262K; the setup scripts honor NUM_CTX
# to rebuild this variant higher (they rewrite this line in the temp
# copy they build from). The KV cache grows linearly with context;
# see docs/HARDWARE.md before raising it on a 64 GB machine.
#
# num_predict is 32768 for Flint: Recursive's model card recommends an
# output budget of at least 32768 tokens for hard problems, reasoning
# included. At the old 8192 a hard turn could spend the whole budget
# thinking and get cut off before answering. Qwen's variant stays 8192.

FROM flint

PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
PARAMETER num_predict 32768
